Common gotchas
Logo not visible: ensure the PNG is in the same folder as index.html and the filename matches exactly (including spaces and capital letters).

Blank page / 404: Pages not enabled on main root, or you uploaded into a subfolder. Move files to repo root and re-set Pages to main/root.

Mixed content/CORS: The code uses https:// everywhere and postcodes.io supports CORS, so you’re fine.

Optional: custom domain or embed on WIX
For a custom domain: Pages → “Custom domain” → add your domain and set DNS CNAME to <username>.github.io.

